# Proxy build — for serving Kasira behind same-origin Nginx (e.g. the HTTPS
# custom domain https://kasira.gabriellabs.my.id). The client then talks to
# Kong through the Nginx /api and /realtime proxy instead of the direct
# http://203.145.35.68:8000, so it works over HTTPS (no mixed-content block).
VITE_USE_PROXY=1